<urn:cm-pharme:v1.0.0:CMPE-C0032> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "CM-PharmE v1.0.0 CMPE-C0032" .
<urn:cm-pharme:v1.0.0:CMPE-C0032> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
