<urn:semrisk:entity:SR-CPT-032> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<urn:semrisk:entity:SR-CPT-032> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A governed information artifact organizing risk register entries for a defined scope; its managed identity persists as entries are added or removed."@en .
