<urn:semrisk:entity:SR-CPT-035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk State"@en .
<urn:semrisk:entity:SR-CPT-035> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.org/nemo/gufo#Situation> .
<urn:semrisk:entity:SR-CPT-035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Core Risk State is situational. Workflow, management-attention, escalation and monitoring classifications stay outside this class unless a later profile explicitly introduces them."@en .
<urn:semrisk:entity:SR-CPT-036> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/conformsTo> "SR-REQ-005; SR-REQ-011" .
