<urn:semrisk:entity:SR-CPT-037> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Externally owned semantic descriptor; deliberately not asserted as a local owl:Class. Generic canonical owner remains unbound in Paper 1; TOGAF 10 and ArchiMate 3.2 are reference/alignment sources, not asserted semantic owners."@en .
