<urn:semrisk:profile:information-state:ArtifactVersion> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An immutable issued information artifact version; a new content-bearing revision receives a new version IRI. Equal content does not identify two issuing acts or versions."@en .
