<urn:semrisk:profile:information-state:InformationContent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abstract informational content, distinct from its managed artifacts and concrete carriers. Content equality is not decided by lexical, hash or numeric equality in this profile."@en .
